NEARS-621 QA — unified search results list does not render (BLOCKER)
Reproduced on every fresh search (e.g. "milk" zone 1, "organic" zone 1).
Header "Items (N)" renders with correct N, but the list area is BLANK and the
Stores section does not paint.

Flutter runtime error (get_runtime_errors), repeats on each search:

  Exception caught by rendering library
  The following assertion was thrown during paint():
  RenderBox was not laid out: RenderShrinkWrappingViewport#... NEEDS-PAINT
  'package:flutter/src/rendering/box.dart':
  Failed assertion: line 2251 pos 12: 'hasSize'
  The relevant error-causing widget was:
    ListView  ListView:file:.../UserApp/lib/features/search/widgets/search_result_widget.dart:282:21

Source: search_result_widget.dart:282 _rowList() returns a
  ListView.separated(shrinkWrap: true, physics: NeverScrollableScrollPhysics(), ...)
used by both _itemsSection (line 180) and _storesSection (line 234), inside
SingleChildScrollView(_scroll, line 68) -> Column(line 140). The shrink-wrapping
viewport is never laid out, so it is invisible at paint time (debug: assertion;
release: zero-size paint -> still invisible). Net effect: the unified two-section
results UI shows headers only, no item/store rows.

NARROWED (loading vs loaded):
- AC7 LOADING skeleton (_loadingList line 295, same shrinkWrap ListView but with
  fixed-size _ItemRowSkeleton / StoreCard.skeleton children) RENDERS fine (3 rows).
- LOADED list (_rowList line 282, children ItemWidget(isStore:false,isGrid:false)
  and SearchStoreCardWidget) FAILS the hasSize paint assertion -> blank.
=> Root cause is in the real row children inside the shrink-wrapped ListView, not
   the ListView pattern itself. Engineer: inspect ItemWidget / SearchStoreCardWidget
   constraints (unbounded width / intrinsic-dimension) when nested in a
   shrinkWrap+NeverScrollable ListView inside a vertical SingleChildScrollView.
